<title>USA: Golden Star files for $75 mln shelf offer.</title>
<headline>Golden Star files for $75 mln shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Star Resources Ltd filed Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $75 million in common shares, preferred shares, convertible debt securities and warrants.</p>
<p>The Denver, Colo.,-based gold and diamond exploration company said net proceeds will be used to finance its operations and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
